    "summary": "Field each Legends unit with the Orks datasheet it is listed under:\n\n- Warbuggies: any of the 4 vehicles **Boomdakka Snazzwagon**, **Kustom Boosta-blasta**, **Megatrakk Scrapjet** and **Shokkjump Dragsta**\n- Dakkajet: **Attack Fighta**\n- Mek Gunz: **Big Gunz**\n- Big Mek in Mega Armour (with a Kustom Force Field): **Big Mek with Kustom Force Field**\n- Biltza Bommer: **Fighta-Bommer**\n- Gunwagon: **Kannonwagon**\n- Gorkanaut: **Mega Dread**\n- Morkanaut: **Meka Dread**\n- Warbikers: **Nobz on Warbikes**\n- Gargantuan Squiggoth: **Squiggoth**\n- Warboss: **Ufthak Blackhawk**\n- Weirdboy: **Wurrboy**",
